  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="meta"><strong>App Name:</strong> Auto Forensic Triage (com.autoforensic.triage)<br />
  <strong>Developer:</strong> Auto Forensic Diagnostics<br />
  <strong>Effective Date:</strong> November 22, 2026</p>

  <p>Auto Forensic Diagnostics ("we," "our," or "us") operates the <strong>Auto Forensic Triage</strong> mobile and web application. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our application.</p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect & How We Use It</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Camera & Photos (Optional):</strong> When you capture or upload photos of vehicle components or repair invoices, images are transmitted securely solely to generate real-time AI diagnostic and parts appraisal reports. We do not sell or permanently store your personal photos.</li>
    <li><strong>Microphone & Audio (Optional):</strong> When you record engine or exhaust noises, audio is processed solely to identify mechanical acoustic patterns and generate diagnostic feedback.</li>
    <li><strong>Diagnostic Text & OBD-II Codes:</strong> Symptom descriptions and OBD-II trouble codes entered by you are processed to return localized repair estimates.</li>
    <li><strong>Subscription & Voucher Data:</strong> Payment transactions are processed securely through third-party payment providers (such as Razorpay) or authorized lifetime redemption codes (such as AppSumo vouchers). We do not store raw credit/debit card numbers on our servers.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>To deliver AI-assisted vehicle diagnostics and payment processing, the app may interact with trusted infrastructure providers including Google Cloud / Gemini AI APIs, Vercel hosting, and Razorpay payment gateways, each governed by their own strict privacy and security standards.</p>

  <h2>3. Data Retention & Deletion</h2>
  <p>Diagnostic inputs are processed ephemerally to fulfill your active request. Local preferences (such as selected vehicle type, language, and subscription unlock status) are stored locally on your device and can be cleared anytime by clearing app storage or uninstalling the application.</p>

  <h2>4. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>Auto Forensic Triage is an automotive utility intended for adult vehicle owners and technicians. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 13.</p>

  <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
  <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or data handling practices, contact us at: <a href="mailto:kk0555265@gmail.com">kk0555265@gmail.com</a></p>
